    "updated_at": "2025-10-28T13:28:00Z",
    "body": "> What makes you say the specification is not aligned with Firefox? I think Firefox is correct here. The `readonly` attribute is not even defined for `button` or `select`.\n\nSince the specification does not say that the `readonly` attribute has an effect on [`form-associated custom elements`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#form-associated-custom-element), Firefox is very close.\n\n@annevk \n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
